      "amount": "tbsp"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
    "Mix almond flour, sea salt, nutritional yeast, and tahini sauce until smooth.",
    "Add beaten egg and cayenne pepper. Mix well until no lumps remain.",
    "Stir in coconut milk and apple cider vinegar. Mix thoroughly.",
    "Pour mixture into a lined baking dish and bake for 30 minutes or until set.",
    "Serve with desired toppings such as salsa, guacamole, sour cream, etc."
